# mdproject — Platform Context

## What this project is

A **general document and presentation library** for writing, editing, and exporting DOCX/PPTX files — proposals, reports, letters, slide decks, assignments, and memos.

The platform is **not** tied to one person. Do **not** assume the Cursor user is Gbadega Adedapo or any named author appearing inside a document.

## Organisation context

Work often relates to **Accessible Publishers Limited** and subsidiaries:

- Oxygen FM Ibadan · Smipay (fintech) · Best Technology (software/websites) · SmartEdu Hub (SMS + LMS)

## Named people in seed documents (content only)

| Name | Where it appears | Meaning |
|------|------------------|---------|
| **Gbadega Adedapo** | Preliminary defense presentation (`seedSlides.ts`, `defenseTheme.ts`, `project.md`, `guide.md`) | DBA **candidate** for that deck only |
| **Gbadega Adedapo** | Some SMEH proposals | **MD/CEO** signatory on proposal letter — not the platform user |

When creating **new** documents, ask for or infer author/signatory from the brief. Do not default new work to Gbadega Adedapo.

## Use cases

- SmartEdu Hub / Accessible proposals and partnership letters
- Company reports, frameworks, and letters
- **Digital marketing (DM) course** assignments — see `dm.md` and digital-marketing-course rule
- DBA preliminary defense deck (one catalog template among many)

## Defaults for new documents

- **`meta.kind: 'document'`** — plain Word-style cover unless user requests proposal or presentation layout
- **Author** — leave blank or use name/org from the user's brief; never assume Gbadega Adedapo
- **Organisation** — Accessible Publishers Limited or relevant subsidiary when appropriate

See **`AGENTS.md`** for document creation and registration rules.
